# Jneopallium code owners
#
# Code owners are requested for review automatically on pull requests touching their paths.
# Roles and how to become an owner: MAINTAINERS.md and GOVERNANCE.md.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so the more specific rules must come after the general ones.

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
*                               @rakovpublic

